# The corpus lives on Hugging Face, not here:
#   center-for-community-news/student-media-feeds
#
# These are regenerated on every pipeline run and were churning megabytes
# through git nightly. Link-rot preservation is not lost -- the Hub holds every
# article body in stories.parquet, and huggingface/restore_full_text.py
# rehydrates full_text/ from it (fail-closed) at the start of each run.
#
# To get the corpus locally:
#   export HF_REPO_ID="center-for-community-news/student-media-feeds"
#   python huggingface/restore_full_text.py
full_text/
publication_corpora/
bag_of_words.csv
publication_story_index.csv
publication_corpora_manifest.csv

# Hugging Face build artifact — regenerated by huggingface/build_hf_dataset.py
# and pushed to the Hub, never committed here (107MB of copies).
huggingface/dataset_build/
